From 93fd3522d422c3337d7ddcd8fe82af5871e945ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:33:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Site polish: accessibility, breadcrumbs, 404, crawlable
 shell, performance

- One h1 per page, single <main>, skip link, focus rings, print styles
- Breadcrumbs with BreadcrumbList data, clean 404 page (noindex)
- Build writes a plain-text page shell, llms.txt, optional Search Console tag
- Self-hosted signature font, compressed images, security and cache headers
- UTM/referrer capture shown on each enquiry, UTM tags on portfolio links
- Shorter titles and descriptions, unused template assets removed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pge4iMEH4KRiFshZJVJL6C
